Spirit Sphere:
Floating balls of light summoned by the [[Summon Spirit Sphere]] skill. Spirit Spheres grant 3 ATK each that always hit, similar to forged weapons imbued with Star Crumb. A player can have a maximum of 5 spheres on them at one time. Certain skills use spirit spheres. A [[Monk]] can transfer a sphere to another player using [[Ki Translation]]. If you have an accessory with a Greatest General Card attached, you will have a chance to get a spirit sphere without needing the summon skill.

